<title>ISRAEL: Israel sees no quick end to violence.</title>
<headline>Israel sees no quick end to violence.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israeli Defence Minister Yitzhak Mordechai said on Friday it would take time to put an end to violence in which more than 60 Palestinians and Israelis have died.</p>
<p>&quot;This wave of violence will certainly take time to quiet down and there are arms and there are casualties,&quot; Mordechai told a news conference in Jerusalem.</p>
</text>
